{cmd:7F090000FF}Lately,{cmd:7F0308}
I've felt like wandering
somewhere far away{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000017}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F2F}
isn't a bad place to live.{cmd:7F030C}
It's just a feeling,{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}Hey,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1A},{cmd:7F0306}
life in {cmd:7F2F}...
{cmd:7F0900000B}Are you happy with it?{cmd:7F1601030104}{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F0D}{cmd:7F0F0FA8}{cmd:7F100FA9}{cmd:7F19}
{cmd:7F01}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Day after day,{cmd:7F0308}
it's the same scenery.
Doesn't it{cmd:7F0308} get boring?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Sometimes,{cmd:7F0308}
I feel like living
in a place I don't know,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F1A},{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F0900000E}
if you know a nice town,
would you take me there?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Even if you say{cmd:7F0306} no,
I'll follow you anyway,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}While you're young,{cmd:7F0304}
it's important to try
living in different places,{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Meeting different people{cmd:7F0308}
and experiencing
different surroundings...{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000014}
{cmd:7F02}Each time, you break
out of your shell!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Experiences you can't have
by staying in one place
must be waiting for you,{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F0900000E}
{cmd:7F02}Perhaps it's about time{cmd:7F0308}
I went somewhere else,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Hmm,{cmd:7F0308} so that's it{cmd:7F0308}.{cmd:7F0308}.{cmd:7F0308}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000004}{cmd:7F0308}But{cmd:7F0306} "somewhat"?
{cmd:7F09000016}What kind of answer is that?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}If you're happy, say so!{cmd:7F0308}
If you're not, say so!{cmd:7F0308}
Speak clearly!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000001}
{cmd:7F02}Honestly,{cmd:7F0304}{cmd:7F09000016}
you're so wishy-washy,
{cmd:7F0304}{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F0900000B}Do you{cmd:7F0306} know about{cmd:7F030C}
Tom Nook's dream?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}Last time I talked to
Tom Nook, he told me...{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}"I want to make lots of money{cmd:7F0308}
and keep making my shop
bigger and bigger"!{cmd:7F030C}
That's what he said!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Heh,{cmd:7F0308} I can't wait to see
just how big he can make it,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}By the way,{cmd:7F0308} your house...{cmd:7F0304}
Can't you make it
any bigger than that?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Follow Tom Nook's example,{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1A}!
Keep at it!{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F0900000F}Hmm,{cmd:7F0308} lately{cmd:7F0304}
I've been in a slump,{cmd:7F0304}
I really have.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}That must be it.{cmd:7F0308}
For a guy like me,{cmd:7F0304}
quiet life in {cmd:7F2F}{cmd:7F0304}
just doesn't fit, I guess.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}Maybe it's about time{cmd:7F0304}
I moved somewhere else.{cmd:7F0304}
Could be good, {cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000016}Ah,{cmd:7F0304} no,{cmd:7F0302} no!{cmd:7F0310}
A guy like me{cmd:7F0306}
can't just waste away here!{cmd:7F0304}
{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000E}Adventure!{cmd:7F0304} Romance!{cmd:7F0304} Courage!{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F0900000A}Exciting things{cmd:7F0308}
must be waiting for me!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}Staring at your silly grin{cmd:7F0304}
every day{cmd:7F0304} would leave me
soft in both body and mind!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}Maybe I should move{cmd:7F0303}.{cmd:7F0303}.{cmd:7F0303}.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000010}Sigh{cmd:7F0303}.{cmd:7F0303}.{cmd:7F0303}.{cmd:7F030E}
Hey,{cmd:7F0304} {cmd:7F1A}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000017}I{cmd:7F0304} may have stayed in
{cmd:7F2F}{cmd:7F0304}
too long,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1C}{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}This sort of life{cmd:7F0304}
